      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقنأ</span></b>  <i>He spoiled</i> a hide, or <i>rendered</i> it <i>unsound.</i>
(O, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقْنَأَنِى الشَّىْءُ</span> <i>The thing became possible
to me,</i> or <i>within my power,</i> (K, TA,) and <i>near to
me.</i> (TA.) ＝   
